// Desktops resources: just the application icon. The first icon resource
// becomes the exe icon (Explorer, taskbar) and the default QWidget window
// icon. The Common-Controls v6 dependency is injected via the linker's
// /MANIFESTDEPENDENCY (see CMakeLists.txt); Qt 6 defaults to PerMonitorV2
// DPI awareness, so no manifest file is needed at all.
1 ICON "resources/desktops.ico"
